{"ref": "Chagigah 12a:16", "heRef": "חגיגה י״ב א:ט״ז", "sectionRef": "Chagigah 12a", "indexTitle": "Chagigah", "heIndexTitle": "חגיגה", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Moed"], "next": "Chagigah 12b", "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "ת\"ר ב\"ש אומרים שמים נבראו תחלה ואח\"כ נבראת הארץ שנאמר בראשית ברא אלהים את השמים ואת הארץ וב\"ה אומרים ארץ נבראת תחלה ואח\"כ שמים שנאמר (בראשית ב, ד) ביום עשות ה' אלהים ארץ ושמים"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "Our Rabbis have taught, The house of Shammai say, The heavens were created first, and afterwards the earth was created, as it is said, (Genesis 1:1) \"In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth.\" But the house of Hillel say, The earth was created first, and afterwards the heavens, as it is said, (Genesis 2:4) \"In the day that the Lord God made earth and heaven.\""}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "http://sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99"}, {"languag